<title>SINGAPORE: Electronic Resources warrants in cross.</title>
<headline>Electronic Resources warrants in cross.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A large block of warrants in electronic parts distributor Electronic Resources Ltd was crossed off market on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>A single block of 11.762 million warrants was married at Singapore $1.85 each.</p>
<p>Dealers said they had no idea what was behind the transaction.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
